mstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292710/extras/627d5ba5b620608d45e9bdd71cfe50c5.webp?t=1751013923\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and utilize a diverse set of items, essential in enabling your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292710/extras/ed5b6c6617de5e034d6ada5c6376dfa5.poster.avif?t=1751013923\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292710/extras/ed5b6c6617de5e034d6ada5c6376dfa5.webm?t=1751013923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292710/extras/ed5b6c6617de5e034d6ada5c6376dfa5.mp4?t=1751013923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>    \u200a    \u200a\u200a  THE SECRETS OF WATERFALL TOWER</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292710/extras/627d5ba5b620608d45e9bdd71cfe50c5.webp?t=1751013923\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploring the tower and learning about the quirks of its strange inhabitants will be paramount to making progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292710/extras/1e8825ce83f43ab4246e663b82752b87.poster.avif?t=1751013923\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292710/extras/1e8825ce83f43ab4246e663b82752b87.webm?t=1751013923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292710/extras/1e8825ce83f43ab4246e663b82752b87.mp4?t=175101392